---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../data/site";
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <p>
    Prime AI Company ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and share
    personal information when you visit primeaicorp.com, submit forms, or engage our training services.
  </p>

  <h2 id="collect">Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact and project data:</strong> name, email, company, and information you provide in the project intake form.</li>
    <li><strong>Training data:</strong> datasets you provide for model training are processed under contract, not for our marketing analytics.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and pages visited (via privacy-oriented analytics if enabled).</li>
    <li><strong>Communications:</strong> emails and messages with {site.emails.sales} or {site.emails.legal}.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="use">How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to inquiries and deliver contracted training services.</li>
    <li>Operate, secure, and improve our website.</li>
    <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms.</li>
    <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="training-data">Customer training data</h2>
  <p>
    Customer datasets are isolated per engagement. We do not use one customer's training data to fine-tune models for another customer
    without explicit permission. Retention and deletion follow the statement of work and Data Processing Addendum.
  </p>

  <h2 id="share">Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We may share data with infrastructure subprocessors (e.g., cloud GPU providers) only as needed to perform services, under
    confidentiality and security obligations. See the <a href="/legal/data-processing">Data Processing</a> summary.
  </p>

  <h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict processing of personal information. Contact{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.legal}`}>{site.emails.legal}</a> to exercise these rights.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.legal}`}>{site.emails.legal}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
